# Work only the section in the prompt

This app is large. A prompt is about one section. Edit that section only.

## Pick the section from the prompt

- Use the route, game, story, or screen the user named (`/games/coin-shop`, trolley, phonics, stories, shop, settings, and so on).
- If the prompt names no section, stay inside the files already in this conversation.
- Do not expand the task into a nearby feature.

## Files you may change

- The section's own page, components, catalog, and helpers.
- A shared list only to add that section: one hub tile, one route label, or one nav entry. Do not change the other entries.

## Files you must not change

- Any other section's pages, components, catalogs, copy, styles, or rules.
- A shared engine when the prompt is about a different section.
- Drive-by refactors, renames, or cleanups outside the section.

## Examples

- Coin shop prompt: edit `app/games/coin-shop`, `components/coin-shop`, and `utils/coinShop.ts`. Do not change `components/trolley` or the trolley star and letter rules.
- Trolley prompt: edit the trolley files only. Do not change the coin shop.
- One phonics letter: edit that letter's media and its catalog row only.
